# Glossary > Agent modes and harness rules
# ipm-overview:docs/glossary.md#L222
# 32b3cda0b610d6636b3bbd17b9ddce57b43ec80b

read mode ::c, validate mode ::c, update mode ::c --> agent mode ::c
design mode ::c, review mode ::c --> agent mode

read-only ::c, writes findings only ::c, writes the model ::c --> write scope ::c
writes a proposal only ::c, writes a review pack only ::c --> write scope

one mode per run ::c, one writer at a time ::c, clean baseline ::c --> harness rule ::c
tests per run ::c, commit after ::c, own commit per mode ::c --> harness rule
reviewed before update ::c --> harness rule
